      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要……要是和您一起的话，我就觉得自己能够成功……！\r\n所以……请您与我一起……一起前进吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad3075f237df9e98747e197ff02a5d90005b4e966c1d3255f216b95c76c91503",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
